{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-10_beg",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-10",
  "title": "Shattered Greenhouse",
  "storyCode": "13-12",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b2c1acd5904957d8ee1c93801df3cad79ed0dde945d64e825b924873db760b04",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Citizen",
      "text": "Good afternoon, Magdelene. Your flowers look just as beautiful as always.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Thanks, Henk. Have you seen Will? I'm looking for him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "He ordered some flowers the first thing this morning, but he still hasn't come to pick them up even though it's afternoon already.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Citizen",
      "text": "Will ordered flowers? Oh, they must be for Freda's birthday.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Citizen",
      "text": "He ditched right around noon. Most likely, he left to prepare whatever surprise he has in store for Freda.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Citizen",
      "text": "Don't worry. He'll remember once Freda gives him a scolding.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Everyone seem very exhausted.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "I've been hearing noises around the work site at night. Has no one been getting any proper rest?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Citizen",
      "text": "The devils are apparently trying to show off for somebody. They're working us to the bone like there's no tomorrow, but I haven't seen any bigwigs visiting, either.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Citizen",
      "text": "You're really lucky that you were given a decent job and don't have to suffer like us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Citizen",
      "text": "I didn't expect us to finish building this in a month just by gritting our teeth a little. It's like a miracle!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Citizen",
      "text": "I'm willing to bet that before, the Londinium lords would've hauled all this into their museums!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "I thought you used to hate this job...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Citizen",
      "text": "Magdelene, the world has changed.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Citizen",
      "text": "(You should try to get on the Sarkaz officer's good side, too. You have nothing to lose, pet.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Thanks for the advice. I'll think it over.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jittery Citizen",
      "text": "Again?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jittery Citizen",
      "text": "How come the cannonfire's sounding closer lately?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jittery Citizen",
      "text": "I heard there's more than one group of folks who want to take over Brentwood. If they come to blows, it'll be a hot mess here again.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jittery Citizen",
      "text": "What's wrong with the way things are now, with everyone getting along? I hope this isn't going to delay our work!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Boy",
      "text": "Magdelene, finally!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Boy",
      "text": "That devil who keeps visiting you brought others to wreck your greenhouse!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "What...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Are you done? I said it's impossible for those Victorians to be hiding here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "That's not for you to say.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "This house is clearly useless, and it's only still standing because you insisted on keeping it around. Who knows what you might be hiding here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Grr, we're all fighting to the death for His Highness, but thanks to you and how weak you are, we've been letting chance after chance go to waste!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Watch your tone, mercenary. I am still a member of the Royal Court and the commander here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Relax. If I find any guerrillas hiding here, I'll off you immediately and apply to join the Royal Court on the achievement.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Now lose that pacifism of yours. I'm getting sick of it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Their actions are a serious interruption to the Military Commission's plans for this place.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "If it wasn't for your setbacks on the front lines fueling their ferocity, the boss wouldn't be having us rush everything to finish our job so quick.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "So you might as well shut up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "My greenhouse...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "No—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "(Shhh—)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "(Don't move. Just watch quietly.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Nnf... nnf—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Relax, your fingers are bleeding.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Don't try to break free.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "(I'm saving your life, <i>Gardener.</i>)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Let her come.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Better that she wants to fight. That way I can just kill her and finish this right here and now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "You're too soft on this town, 'Commander'.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Glaring won't kill me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Ugh, what a drag.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Flowers mean nothing to this war.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Armories, explosives, incinerators. That's what you really need.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Let me go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "I'm calm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Have you found what you were looking for?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Count yourself lucky that I didn't.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Then please leave.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Heh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "I thought you'd have a bit more guts than those idiots at the work site.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Hmph, Victorians.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Don't move. Your fingers need bandaging.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "I couldn't stop them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "I... had some setbacks on the front lines.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Soon, there will be another here to take over for me. He... He has other plans for the town.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "There's an opening in the cement construction about two hundred meters to the west of the town's entrance. The guerrillas nearby blew it open.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "They won't give this chance up, so we need to fix this opening by 5 AM tomorrow.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "The roses can still be saved. You must find a way to plant these poor things again.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "If that opening piques your interest... take these roses and cut through our camp tonight. It's the safest route.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "If somebody stops you, tell them you're delivering an order for me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Of course, I'd be very happy if you could stop by and put a rose in front of my tent.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Some things should never be ruined, <i>Gardener.</i>",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "My name is not <i>Gardener,</i> Sarkaz. It's Magdelene.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Hm, then let us reintroduce ourselves. My name is <i>Shovel.</i>",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "<i>Shovel?</i>",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Remember, Magdelene. Time waits for no one.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "His tent should be in this direction... I have to take the flowers there as soon as I can.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "What's that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "What are you doing here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "Magdelene!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Where are you going with those flowers past curfew?\nThat's the direction of the barracks you're going. Hurry up and leave!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "I... It's fine. I just wanted to come outside for a walk.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Right, I heard from Henk that it's your birthday today. Happy birthday! Will ordered some flowers for you, but he never came for them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "If you see Will, please remind him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Freda?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Why aren't you saying anything?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "Come with me. It's not safe here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Huh... These flowers...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "Will left them here to mourn my father. I've been keeping the warehouse locked, only occasionally lending him the key when he wants a sip of alcohol.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "The cannons here, did Mr. West prepare them for the festival? How magnificent...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "It's all my fault...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Did something happen to him?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "He was stopped by the devils at the Sarkaz barracks just now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "He came to me earlier than usual for some sort of surprise, but when he found out I was going to the barracks to report on our progress, and he said he'd escort me there...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "But the Sarkaz shouldn't have any reason to stop Will... They've never done that before.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "I don't know... I'm scared. I didn't have it in me to say no when they asked to take Will in...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "I've been following their every word. I gave them everything they asked for. Why did they want to take him?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "Why... Did I do something wrong...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Maybe they only had a few questions for him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Look on the bright side. They still need him to work for them!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "Right... That bloody thing isn't completed just yet. I am sure they still need Will.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "I have to stay here at the barracks' entrance and wait for him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "......?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "......?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Freda... Did you see that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "Was it... looking at us just now?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
